mV3FBfVfYfaR66)\n\n### Comment\n> Restaurant reservations don&#039;t load in Google maps.\n\n\n\n### Screenshots\n<details>\n  <summary>Screenshot 1</summary>\n\n  ![Screenshot 1](https://cdn.adguardcdn.com/sitereports/j8md9bi3n08ws4osgwco0gosckoc0k9h7l5q0somos.png?nc=1)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>Screenshot 1 with AdGuard disabled</summary>\n\n  ![Screenshot 1](https://cdn.adguardcdn.com/sitereports/tky6kvkwilcgs0ccgcow8484ks000s4j26gty1yw4o.png?nc=1)\n</details>\n\n### System configuration\n\n| Information | Value |\n|-------------|-------|\nAdGuard product: | AdGuard for Android v4.12.3\nSystem version: | `Android 17`\nBrowser: | Google Maps App (not browser)\nLicense type: | paid\nAdGuard mode: | VPN\nHTTPS filtering: | enabled\nAndroid system root: | no\nFilters: | **Ad Blocking:**<br>AdGuard Mobile Ads filter, <br>AdGuard Base filter<br><br>**Security:**<br>Online Malicious URL Blocklist\nTracking protection: | disabled\nDNS filtering: | server: `System`<br>filters: `https://filters.adtidy.org/android/filters/15_optimized.txt`\nBrowsing Security: | enabled\nBrowsing Security statistics: | disabled\nUserscripts: | `https://userscripts.adtidy.org/release/adguard-extra/1.0/adguard-extra.meta.js`\nUserstyles: | disabled\nOther extensions used: | `On Google maps, the reservation feature gets blocked. Turning off adguard fixes it. `\n\n\n\n### Issue configuration\n[Import](https://reports.adguard.com/settings/import.html?product_type=and&amp;product_version=4.12.3&amp;system_version=Android+17&amp;browser=other&amp;browser_detail=Google+Maps+App+%28not+browser%29&amp;filters=11.208.2&amp;dns.servers=System&amp;userscripts=https%253A%252F%252Fuserscripts.adtidy.org%252Frelease%252Fadguard-extra%252F1.0%252Fadguard-extra.meta.js&amp;android.mode=VPN&amp;android.system_root=false&amp;dns.filters=https%253A%252F%252Ffilters.adtidy.org%252Fandroid%252Ffilters%252F15_optimized.txt&amp;dns.filters_enabled=true&amp;dns.enabled=true&amp;https.filtering=true&amp;bro